<title>GERMANY: German traders seek free mkt wheat, barley exports.</title>
<headline>German traders seek free mkt wheat, barley exports.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>German grain traders are seeking export restitutions for the export of 5,000 tonnes of free market soft wheat in a range between 9.90 and 14.95 Ecus per tonne, the state grain intervention board BLE said.</p>
<p>Traders at the weekly EU grain export tender also sought rebates for the export of 34,000 tonnes of free market barley in a 24.95-34.01 Ecus/tonne range.</p>
<p>--Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
